{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"3f027f7e5dca6f70","type":"text","text":"# Software Development Hub\n\n### General\n\nVery well structured website. Look and feel 10/10.\nVery similar to Sonrisa, but smaller 100+ employees, with offices in Hamburg, Ucraine, and Canada\n\n### Services\n\nSoftware development, IT Consulting, T&M and Cloud Service and Devops\n\n### Pricing\n\nOn average this is 60-65 USD / hour. Packages are similar to our packages.\n\n[AWS Cloud Management Services \\| DevOps Automation – 24/7 Support](https://sdh.global/aws-devops-services/)\n","x":-880,"y":-200,"width":671,"height":500,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f55b2deac47f5df5","type":"text","text":"# CTO as a Service\nSimilar to Sonrisa's Consultancy Package\n\nFixed package, and T&M\n[Fetching Title#6h57](https://sdh.global/services/cto-as-a-service/)\n","x":-1320,"y":420,"width":351,"height":202,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d2908db5004920ab","type":"text","text":"# Cloud Migration Services\nFrom OnPrem to **AWS, Google and Azure**\n\n- Infrastructure migration to cloud\n- Platform migration\n- Database migration\n- Application migration\n\n[Cloud Migration Services Company \\| SDH](https://sdh.global/services/cloud-migration/)","x":-920,"y":420,"width":480,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"347d1a070d808b17","type":"text","text":"# DevOps consultation\n- Free initial consultation up to 30 minutes\n- Audit from $2000 \n- Business consultation\n- Developer consultation\n- Fixed packages / month\n\n[[Cloud Migration Services Company \\| SDH](https://sdh.global/services/cloud-migration/)](https://sdh.global/devops-consulting-solutions/)","x":-360,"y":422,"width":481,"height":296,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f7f83a62d4112137","type":"text","text":"# Managed DevOps Services\n\n**Very well structure presentation of the service**\n3 tiers: 2000, 4000  and  6000 USD\nFixed nr. of support hours included.\n\n#CICD_idea how can they afford a 50 USD / h avergae price including 24/7 support as well.\n\n24/7 Support included in the top tier.\n\n[DevOps Managed Services \\| End-to-End Solutions Provider \\| SDH](https://sdh.global/fully-managed-devops-services/)","x":200,"y":420,"width":660,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"73aab808dd3ae1a7","type":"text","text":"# Managed **AWS** DevOps Services\n\n**Very well structure presentation of the service**\n3 tiers: 2000, 4000  and  6000 USD\nFixed nr. of support hours included.\n\n#CICD_idea how can they afford a 50 USD / h avergae price including 24/7 support as well.\n\n24/7 Support included in the top tier.\n\n[DevOps Managed Services \\| End-to-End Solutions Provider \\| SDH](https://sdh.global/fully-managed-devops-services/)","x":200,"y":760,"width":660,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"8e66208deb071fa2","type":"text","text":"# RomexSoft\n\n### General\n\nWell structured site\nVery similar to Sonrisa, but smaller 50+ employees Ucraine\n\n### Services\n\nSoftware development, IT Consulting, T&M and Cloud Service and Devops\n**AWS Advanced Tier**, **Security compliance HIPAA, PCI, SOC1, SOC2**\n\n### Pricing\n\nOn average this is 60-65 USD / hour. Packages are similar to our packages.\n\n[[AWS Cloud Management Services \\| DevOps Automation – 24/7 Support](https://sdh.global/aws-devops-services/)](https://www.romexsoft.com/)\n","x":-820,"y":-1480,"width":671,"height":540,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"8cef04c7c2069ca9","type":"text","text":"# 24/7 DevOps Support\n\n3 Tiered model:\n- **Startup (4300)**\n- **Business (5700)**\n- **Enterprise (Custom)**\n\nHigher prices then ours, bundled into the package.\n\n[[Fetching Title#6h57](https://sdh.global/services/cto-as-a-service/)](https://www.romexsoft.com/services/devops-support/)\n","x":-1140,"y":-1900,"width":600,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ffd2ccc571649ac0","type":"text","text":"# DevOps Services\n\nFixed and T&M based services\n\n\n\n[[Fetching Title#6h57](https://sdh.global/services/cto-as-a-service/)](https://www.romexsoft.com/services/devops-support/)\n","x":-449,"y":-1900,"width":600,"height":180,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"9ec001ee86533757","type":"text","text":"# # AWS Consulting Services\n\nFixed and T&M based services\n\n[AWS Consulting Services](https://www.romexsoft.com/aws/cloud-consulting-services/)\n\n","x":240,"y":-1900,"width":600,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"2ac13ac41447cfa1","type":"text","text":"# # AWS Migration Services\n\nFixed and T&M based services\n\n[AWS Consulting Services](https://www.romexsoft.com/aws/cloud-consulting-services/)\n\n","x":240,"y":-1720,"width":600,"height":160,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"bff552bb3e5a3e39","type":"text","text":"# Security consulting\n\nFixed and T&M based services\n\n[Fetching Title#hf1n](https://www.romexsoft.com/aws/security-conuslting-services/)\n\n","x":920,"y":-1900,"width":600,"height":160,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"2013b4faef5f7235","type":"text","text":"# Dedicatted\n\n### General\n\nWell structured site, Offices in Estonia, Poland and Canada, 200 employees\n\n### Services\n\nVery similar to Sonrisa, but it seems more DevOps oriented and has a harware edge as well.\nSecurity Certifications, very strong AWS Partners, Azure and GCP partners\nHigh price point for Gold Tier\n**Very well structured webpage, they are educating the user as well** #CICD_idea \n**Very important: discount on their AWS Billing!!!**\n\n### Pricing\n\nOn average this is 60-65 USD / hour. Packages are similar to our packages.\n\n[[AWS Cloud Management Services \\| DevOps Automation – 24/7 Support](https://sdh.global/aws-devops-services/)](https://www.romexsoft.com/)\n","x":2360,"y":-1210,"width":671,"height":540,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"5d4c3130640cc13d","type":"text","text":"# # Generative AI\n\nWell structured offer, educating the client as well\nFixed and T&M based services\n\n[Generative AI](https://dedicatted.com/services/generative-ai)\n\n","x":1940,"y":-1660,"width":600,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0a635c33fcbcf064","type":"text","text":"# Agentic AI\n\nWell structured offer, educating the client as well\nFixed and T&M based services\n\n[Agentic AI](https://dedicatted.com/services/artificial-intelligence/agentic)\n\n","x":1940,"y":-1900,"width":600,"height":190,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"7aa8e1712a343a15","type":"text","text":"# Security Comliance\n\nStrong security comliance, something that we also need #CICD_idea \nApplication security, Security Compliance, and Cloud security\nSOC2 and ISO 27001\n\n\n","x":2620,"y":-1660,"width":600,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ed1e3de098839993","type":"text","text":"# Key Takeaways\n\n##### Security is needed\n- SOC2 and ISO 27001\n\n##### Parnerships \n- AWS\n- Azure \n- GCP\n- Hashi?\n\nLike Dedicattes, we have to educate the clients as well. Shows professionalism and empathy.\n\n##### Add-ons\nDedicatted mentions that the price is a starting price and with add-on the client can add new services. This is important in case of 24/7 On Call Support\n\n##### Services\n- DR (Disaster Recovery) simulations\n- Patch management\n- Security enchancements\n- cost optimization\n- Technical Account Management \n- **ITIL** framework","x":-607,"y":-5177,"width":847,"height":877,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"785ab4add3c46505","type":"text","text":"# Case Study - Colosseum Dental\n\nComponent based Managed Service. *Not sure if the component based part is important to the client*\n\n**Added value / Services**\n- Proactive monitoring\n- Account Management - single point of contact\n- 30 min / incident handling. \n  \n  ","x":340,"y":-5160,"width":847,"height":437,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a9be691af0808a79","type":"text","text":"## They highlight **6 ITSM processes** across tiers. These are ITIL-based standards for running IT services:\n\n1. **Incident Management** – restoring normal service when something breaks.  \n    _Example_: A server crashes → log ticket → fix within SLA.\n    \n2. **Request Management** – handling routine user requests.  \n    _Example_: A developer requests access to a new AWS S3 bucket.\n    \n3. **Knowledge Management** – documenting solutions, FAQs, runbooks.  \n    _Example_: Writing a knowledge base article on how to restart a Kubernetes pod safely.\n    \n4. **Change Management** – controlling changes to systems to reduce risk.  \n    _Example_: Approving a planned database upgrade after risk review.\n    \n5. **Release Management** (Gold+) – planning and controlling new software releases.  \n    _Example_: Coordinating a new microservice rollout across environments.\n    \n6. **Problem Management** (Gold+) – finding root causes of recurring incidents.  \n    _Example_: Investigating why CPU spikes happen weekly and permanently fixing the underlying app bug.","x":360,"y":-4563,"width":960,"height":443,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ebe16278a6006707","type":"text","text":"## Upsell opportinities\n\n- Package in the Continuity as an addon or a specific Tier\n- Palak had an intrestng idea: Keep *DevOs as a Service* and *SRE as a Service* separate","x":1440,"y":-4563,"width":960,"height":443,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"4c3e51fc593c5dad","type":"text","text":"\n\n\n  ","x":1280,"y":-5160,"width":847,"height":437,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ea96626caf4d5d77","type":"text","text":"# Managed Services\n\n3 Tiered service, but not fixed price but an estimation.\n- Silver: 4000 USD +\n- Gold: 8500 USD +\n- Platinum: 20000 USD +: Built in end-to-end ownership\n\n","x":3360,"y":-1740,"width":600,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"93a21aa0ab438361","type":"text","text":"# DevOpsGroup\n\n### General\n\nSlovakia based company\nTheir website us not as well structured as the other competitors website.\n\n### Services\n\nPrebuilt infrastructure, they are selling and managing it for a low price.\nThey have lik 80-100+ employees\n### Pricing\nInitial cost + very low subscription fee. Very clear description of the prebuilt infra they provide.\n\n\n[DevOps & Cloud Services, AWS \\| Azure \\| GCP, Kubernetes,](https://devopsgroup.eu/)","x":2360,"y":-120,"width":671,"height":540,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a5ac653d79621a5a","type":"text","text":"# Prebuilt infra + Managed Services\n\n3 Tiered prebuilt infra with managed service\n\nIt seems that they are selling the code and infra which is prebuilt, and the service feed hence can be much lower. They are overseeing their own infra and they don't take over other infras. \n","x":2396,"y":600,"width":600,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"2512adca418eedd7","type":"text","text":"# Palark\n\n### General\n\n\n### Services\nThey are keeping DevOps as a Service and SRE as a Service separate.\nBasically what we offer for 4000 USD they offer it for 6200 USD\nAnd what we plan to offer for 6000 USD they are doing it dor 9100 USD + \n\nThey are based in Germany, hence the double price tag. But it is smart to show the hourly rates as well, give trust. Although it is not cheap.\n\n### Pricing\n\n[DevOps as a Service pricing & plans \\| Palark](https://palark.com/pricing/)","x":4880,"y":-1210,"width":671,"height":540,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c6221e5dee37485f","type":"text","text":"# DevOps as a Service\n\n- 2 Tiers only (3000 USD and 6200 USD)\n- they are focusing on keeping things running\n- Collaboration with the client's developer team\n- Including consultancy hours\n- In project hours.\n\n\n\n\n[DevOps as a Service pricing & plans \\| Palark](https://palark.com/pricing/)","x":4560,"y":-1605,"width":600,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"55a7452360cf300f","type":"text","text":"# Site Reliability Engineering\n\n- 3 Tiers (9100 USD and 11.700 USD and 14.000)\n- More hours\n- Dev + prod environment\n- 24/7 On call support\n\n\n\n\n[DevOps as a Service pricing & plans \\| Palark](https://palark.com/pricing/)","x":5216,"y":-1605,"width":600,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d4f1624343bcbb10","type":"text","text":"# DevOps Emergency\n\n- [DevOps as a Service pricing & plans \\| Palark](https://palark.com/pricing/)\n\n- €120 per hour for the work rendered  at 9:00-18:00 CET during business days.\n- €150 per hour for the work at other times.\n  \n  They are helping within an hour.","x":5880,"y":-1605,"width":600,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"46b1f25724274fd8","type":"text","text":"# cloud Migration\n\n- T and M based","x":5880,"y":-900,"width":600,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"aa6282fbc4d8912f","type":"text","text":"# CI/CD Audit\n\n- Another smart move, price starts from 1200 USD","x":5880,"y":-580,"width":600,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"3d9e8ba38daee39e","type":"text","text":"# Self hosted LLM\n\n- Self hosted LLM\n\n[Private, self-hosted LLM \\| Palark](https://palark.com/services/private-self-hosted-llm/)","x":5216,"y":-580,"width":600,"height":270,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b339c98d02885428","type":"text","text":"# Infrasnap\n\n### General\n\n\n### Services\nPrebuilt infra for clients, with fixed scope.\nThey are not doing management just building the infra (not sure why... ?)\n\n### Pricing\n\nHard to tell anything about pricing, prebuilt infra can contain huge margins 40%+\nThey have a UK based headquarter\n\n\n[[DevOps as a Service pricing & plans \\| Palark](https://palark.com/pricing/)](https://solutions.corewide.com/)","x":4680,"y":195,"width":671,"height":540,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1a4f9b06ea36b370","type":"text","text":"# Prebuilt infra in kubernetes\n\nAt all major cloud providers.","x":4716,"y":870,"width":600,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"0aeac0145a04a21e","type":"text","text":"# Kloia\n\n### General\n\n\n### Services\n\n\n\nSeparate package for\n\n### Pricing\n\nHard to tell anything about pricing, prebuilt infra can contain huge margins 40%+\nThey have a UK based headquarter\n\n\n[[DevOps as a Service pricing & plans \\| Palark](https://palark.com/pricing/)](https://solutions.corewide.com/)","x":6960,"y":150,"width":671,"height":540,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"b1b924f8b518baf8","type":"text","text":"# DevOps as a Service\n\n**3 Step process**\n1. Migration, it is not clear whether is it T&M, or is it free?\n2. Then the SLA and monitoring\n3. Step 3 They offer some development, but again not clear how many hours. This\n\nOverall this is quite expensive and not clear what are they offering at the end.","x":6820,"y":-340,"width":600,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"3774465f006d35bf","type":"text","text":"# Application Modernization\n\nTake your application and restructure it , run it on cloud","x":7560,"y":-340,"width":600,"height":300,"color":"3"},
